# Wraith, Vicious Vigilante (1/1, {1}{W}{U}): "Double strike. Fear Gas — Wraith can't be blocked." Bot2's Memnite may not block Wraith, but it
# may block Bot1's own Memnite attacking beside it (the restriction is Wraith's alone, CR 509.1b). Wraith deals 1 first-strike damage and 1
# regular damage (CR 702.4b): Bot2 goes from 20 to 18.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Wraith, Vicious Vigilante
Memnite
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wraith, Vicious Vigilante.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
